      "result_description": "Mold CC - 2nd XI - Band1",
      "result_applied_to": "27381",
      "match_notes": "<p>An amazing game which&nbsp;contained 11 ducks(!) and went down to the wire. The wicket was excellent despite the weeks rain and it was young bowlers who were the stars of the show. For Denbigh Archie Sussex&nbsp;took 4 for 6, For Mold George Jones took 4 for 9 but it was m.o.m Josh Jones who made the difference for Mold, taking 3 for 18 and then marshalling the lower order with 17 not out when the collapse was on! Mold got over the line, just-&nbsp;with 1 wicket to spare. Cricket can be the closest of games sometimes!</p><br>",
